### Environment Test
### Use this file to verify environment switching works correctly
### 
### INSTRUCTIONS:
### 1. Press Ctrl+Shift+P
### 2. Type "Rest Client: Switch Environment"
### 3. Select an environment (dev, local, docker, prod)
### 4. Run the test below - it should show the selected environment's URL

### Test Current Environment
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### Variables in current environment:
### baseUrl: {{baseUrl}}
### apiUrl: {{apiUrl}}  
### frontendUrl: {{frontendUrl}}

### Expected responses by environment:
### - dev: http://localhost:8080/api/health (frontend: :5173)
### - local: http://localhost:8080/api/health (frontend: :3000)
### - docker: http://localhost:8080/api/health (frontend: :8080)
### - prod: http://localhost:8080/api/health (frontend: :8080)